{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>She sent forth her maidens; she calls from the highest places of the city</b> — גפי is like גבי, for the letters bet, vav, mem, peh interchange." "<b>City</b> — the Aramaic translation [Targum] is עיר. And the meaning: she sent forth her maidens from every side, and she too, with them, calls from the high places of the city, so that all will hear."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:38.603088471Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}